# Shang-Chi's "You may activate abilities of creatures you control as though those creatures had haste" is a static
# ability (CR 604.1): it works only while Shang-Chi is on the battlefield. Turn 1 Bot1 casts Shang-Chi and Llanowar Elves;
# then Mox Ruby's {R} casts Lightning Bolt at Shang-Chi. Once it is gone, the Elves, still summoning sick (CR 302.6), can't
# tap for mana; on turn 3, under Bot1's control since the turn began, they can.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Shang-Chi, Master of Kung Fu
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

